sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant F6 as Waypoint Capture
    participant F1 as Perception
    participant F2 as Localization
    participant F3 as Semantic Understanding
    participant F4 as Semantic Memory

    Operator ->> F6: trigger(capture_event)
    activate F6
    F6 ->> F1: request(latest_visual_frame)
    F1 -->> F6: VisualFrame
    F6 ->> F2: request(current_pose)
    F2 -->> F6: RobotPose
    F6 ->> F3: encode(VisualFrame) → SemanticVector
    activate F3
    F3 -->> F6: SemanticVector [modality=VISUAL]
    deactivate F3
    F6 ->> F4: store(WaypointRecord{id, pose, embedding})
    F4 -->> F6: ack(stored)
    F6 -->> Operator: status(waypoint_captured)
    deactivate F6
